00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:16.240
del modelo

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:16.840
sin poderes

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:17.820
de administrador global?

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:19.420
Es el amortiguador

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:19.920
burocrático

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:20.540
que evita que sus

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.420
administradores de SharePoint

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.380
